    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sam, stop Tom. If we don't, the world will perish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two have been childhood friends since elementary school. The two went to the same school in junior high and high school, and recognized each other as best friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the summer of his second year of college, Tom dropped out. Due to family circumstances, Tom had to work. From then on, we gradually passed each other\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later, Sam started his own business right after graduating from university and made a fortune with a social media app. He was living a smooth life until he realized, ``Even though I created an app that anyone could connect with, I still haven't met the person I really want to meet,'' so he decides to go see Tom on his birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Sam didn't notice. Tom isn't the Tom he was back then\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-person action battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is an action battle game from a third-person perspective. Toms with different attack patterns will appear in each stage and will stand in your way. Observe Tom's movements carefully and find an opening to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer stages full of gimmicks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are some places where you can't fight Tom unless you conquer the stage. Move Sam well and clear the labyrinth stages and falling stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tense battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sam isn't a superhero in the comics, he's just a company president. Therefore, there is no way to recover HP, and you cannot continue. Break through the approaching Tom while maintaining your limited HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time attack function</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows you to check the current time while playing the game. Play over and over and beat Tom the fastest to set a personal record.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sam, stop Tom. If we don't, the world will perish.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synopsis</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two have been childhood friends since elementary school. The two went to the same school in junior high and high school, and recognized each other as best friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the summer of his second year of college, Tom dropped out. Due to family circumstances, Tom had to work. From then on, we gradually passed each other\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Later, Sam started his own business right after graduating from university and made a fortune with a social media app. He was living a smooth life until he realized, ``Even though I created an app that anyone could connect with, I still haven't met the person I really want to meet,'' so he decides to go see Tom on his birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Sam didn't notice. Tom isn't the Tom he was back then\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third-person action battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work is an action battle game from a third-person perspective. Toms with different attack patterns will appear in each stage and will stand in your way. Observe Tom's movements carefully and find an opening to attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer stages full of gimmicks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are some places where you can't fight Tom unless you conquer the stage. Move Sam well and clear the labyrinth stages and falling stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A tense battle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sam isn't a superhero in the comics, he's just a company president. Therefore, there is no way to recover HP, and you cannot continue. Break through the approaching Tom while maintaining your limited HP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time attack function</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows you to check the current time while playing the game. Play over and over and beat Tom the fastest to set a personal record.</p>",
